#: bot.py:295
msgid ""
"<b>How to connect a channel</b>\n"
"\n"
"1. Open your channel → Administrators → Add admin\n"
"2. Pick me and leave the <b>Add members</b> right enabled\n"
"3. I will write to you right away — switch auto-approve on there\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ Only the channel <b>owner</b> can connect it. An administrator is not "
"enough.\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ Join requests that are already pending stay pending: Telegram gives "
"bots no way to read them. Approve those once by hand — everything after "
"that is on me."
